// Axiom Compiler — MIR Optimization Pipeline (`compiler.opt`)
// Port of bootstrap/axiom0/src/opt/opt.h and bootstrap/axiom0/src/opt/opt.c.
//
// Coordinates the `-O1` MIR optimization passes:
//   1. `opt_const_fold`: constant folding for binary, overflow-check, and unary rvalues
//   2. `opt_dce`: iterative dead code elimination for unused locals and storage markers
//   3. `opt_cfg_simplify`: constant switch folding and unreachable basic block cleanup
//      (plus `opt_cfg_eliminate_redundant_switches` and `opt_cfg_merge_linear_blocks`)
// Optionally invokes `verify_mir` after each pass when `verify_each` is enabled (`--verify-mir`).
module compiler.opt

